This is a separate component from the commercial offline30-layer RE-USE model.

The exporter preserves selected learned FP32 tensors and expresses per-hop
causal convolution/Mamba state as explicit ONNX inputs/outputs. The reference
loads SHA-verified original NVIDIA modules and extracts the published online
wrapper classes without running its CUDA/download CLI.

